            "detailed_description": "Rubber &amp; Lead is a homage to AutoDuel, a fantastic game from 1985. Action and RPG elements are blended together to create an exciting combination! You must drive and shoot your way through post-apocalyptic Arizona. Choose your mission, upgrade your car, equip your weapons, and blast away your enemies! <strong>Warning: Driving without shooting can be fatal. </strong><br><br>Game Features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fight In Arenas <br></li><li>Run Missions <br></li><li>Level Your Skills <br></li><li>Buy A New Car <br></li><li>Upgrade Your Car <br></li><li>Buy Perks <br></li><li>Blow Raiders Up <br></li><li>Have A Lovely Day</li></ul>",
